OL,3,GNEWSAUS military aircraft leave second
OL,4,AUK base
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 10 US Air Force refuelling
OL,7,Faircraft left a second airbase in
OL,8,FBritain on Monday.
OL,10,FFlight tracking data reviewed by BBC
OL,11,FVerify shows the aircraft left RAF
OL,12,FMildenhall in Suffolk and landed at
OL,13,Fother American bases in Europe and also
OL,14,Fat Prestwick Airport in Ayrshire,
OL,15,FScotland.
OL,17,FThe Wall Street Journal reported that
OL,18,Fthis was in response to a threat from
OL,19,FIran but the BBC has not independently
OL,20,Fverified that claim.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
